WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.000
Sin, es ta ben li pa ameasa.

2
00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:13.905
Dipôs ten alguns kasa ki ta bai abaxu,
ma ka tudu.

3
00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:17.450
Dja pesoas staba tudu dizesperadu.

4
00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:24.729
Pesoa ku familia, ora ki kasa bai abaxu,
pa undi ki pesoa ta bai?

5
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.365
Ka ten lugar. Si es ta daba pesoas kasa,

6
00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.206
mésmu pa paga renda, pesoas ta bai.

7
00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:37.807
Gosi, sen kasa, kusé ki pesoa ta bai faze?
Fika na rua?

8
00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:39.868
Bive ku familia na rua?

9
00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:46.509
Dja éra tristeza,
éra txeu kumplikadu mésmu.

10
00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:52.050
Bu ten medu ma kel-la pode kontise?
N ten medu, sin. N ten medu.

11
00:00:52.555 --> 00:00:57.308
I kes dia ki es ta ben
li pa manda kasa abaxu,

12
00:00:57.439 --> 00:01:01.011
N ka ta bai trabadju,
pamodi é tántu medu...

13
00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:07.110
Dita i ka durmi, pamodi N ka sabe
ki dia ki es ta ben manda abaxu.

14
00:01:07.746 --> 00:01:13.420
N ka ten un dia, N ka ten kasa.
Sin, é kel-la.
